            Photo <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-sky-300 to-blue-400">Gallery</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-sky-200/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-sans leading-relaxed">
            Authentic moments of street evangelism, worship, discipleship, and community life at Emmanuel United Church of Maryland.
